---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
import '../styles/about.css';
const portrait = 'https://sdld3v8bpzf3snqo.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/blog/about/mager-human.jpg';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <BaseHead title={`About · ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="Mager is a software engineer in Chicago on Uber's AI team, building AI agents and writing about what works." image="/images/mager.jpg" />
  </head>
  <body class="publication">
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to content</a>
    <Header homepage themeToggle />
    <main id="main-content" class="about-page">
      <section class="about-intro" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
        <div class="about-copy">
          <p class="about-kicker">About / Chicago</p>
          <h1 id="about-heading">Hi, I’m <span>mager.</span></h1>
          <p class="about-lead">I'm a software engineer in Chicago. I work on the AI team at Uber, focusing on skills and efficiency.</p>
          <p>I build AI agents, developer tools, and weird internet products, then write about what worked, what broke, and what I learned along the way.</p>
          <nav class="about-links" aria-label="Find me elsewhere">
            <a href="https://github.com/mager">GitHub ↗</a>
            <a href="https://x.com/mager">X ↗</a>
            <a href="https://loooom.xyz/me/mager">ME.md ↗</a>
          </nav>
        </div>
        <figure class="about-portrait">
          <button class="portrait-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Show human photo" aria-pressed="false" aria-describedby="portrait-hint" disabled>
            <img class="portrait-avatar" src="/images/mager.jpg" alt="Hot Dougs avatar: a character in a cap eating pizza." width="800" height="800" fetchpriority="high" />
            <img class="portrait-human" src={portrait} alt="Mager smiling in a baseball cap." width="800" height="800" aria-hidden="true" />
          </button>
          <figcaption>
            <span class="portrait-credit">Hot Dougs avatar by <a href="https://x.com/hopperdraws">@hopperdraws</a></span>
            <span id="portrait-hint" class="portrait-hint" hidden><span class="pointer-hint">Hover to meet the human.</span><span class="touch-hint">Tap to switch portraits.</span></span>
          </figcaption>
          <noscript><a class="portrait-fallback" href={portrait}>See my human photo ↗</a></noscript>
        </figure>
      </section>
      <div class="about-notes">
        <section aria-labelledby="about-tech">
          <h2 id="about-tech"><a href="/tech/">Tech ↗</a></h2>
          <p>Most of what I care about right now sits around agents, context, and software that feels alive. My Mac mini is my always-on box for agent workflows.</p>
          <p>I'm interested in harnesses, memory, evals, workflows, and how you make AI useful inside a real product stack.</p>
        </section>
        <section aria-labelledby="about-life">
          <h2 id="about-life"><a href="/life/">Life ↗</a></h2>
          <p>Outside of code, I post the occasional travel note, family story, or thing I want to remember. I've been getting back to trying new products early and bringing readers along, something familiar from writing The Web Life at ZDNET.</p>
        </section>
        <section aria-labelledby="about-cooking">
          <h2 id="about-cooking"><a href="/cooking/">Cooking ↗</a></h2>
          <p>I cook constantly. Soups, braises, rice, pasta, whatever I'm iterating on that week. Cooking and software scratch the same itch for me: small decisions compounding into something better when you pay attention.</p>
        </section>
      </div>
      <a class="about-archive" href="/blog/">Explore the writing <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </main>
    <Footer homepage />
  </body>
</html>
<script>
  import '../scripts/portrait';
</script>
